# U-Haul

Founded in 1945, U-Haul is the No. 1 choice of do-it-yourself movers, providing truck and trailer rentals, portable moving containers (U-Box), self-storage, moving supplies, vehicle towing equipment, hitch installation, moving labor, and propane services across the US and Canada.

> U-Haul operates more than 25,000 rental locations across all 50 states and 10 Canadian provinces. The fleet includes approximately 204,800 trucks, 136,600 trailers, and 42,000 towing devices. U-Haul is the third largest storage operator in North America with 1,136,000 rentable storage units and 99 million square feet of self-storage space at owned and managed facilities, and offers a 1-Year Price Lock guarantee to self-storage customers. U-Haul is the top retailer of propane in the U.S. and the largest installer of permanent trailer hitches in the automotive aftermarket industry. Reservations can be made online at uhaul.com or via the U-Haul app (available on the App Store and Google Play).

